h><\/tr><tr><td class=\"fieldname\">PRS_Status_select_0<\/td><td class=\"fielddescription\"><p style=\"color:inherit\">PRS status 0 output signal. <\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"fieldname\">PRS_Status_select_1<\/td><td class=\"fielddescription\"><p style=\"color:inherit\">PRS status 1 output signal. <\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><br><\/div><\/div><div class=\"def-class-section\"><h2>Typedef Documentation<span id=\"typedef-definition\" class=\"self-anchor\"><a class=\"perm\" href=\"#typedef-definition\">#<\/a><\/span><\/h2><div><h3>CMU_ClkDiv_TypeDef<span id=\"cmu-clk-div-type-def\" class=\"self-anchor\"><a class=\"perm\" href=\"#cmu-clk-div-type-def\">#<\/a><\/span><\/h3><blockquote>typedef uint32_t CMU_ClkDiv_TypeDef <\/blockquote><p style=\"color:inherit\">Clock divider configuration. <\/p><br><\/div><\/div><div class=\"def-class-section\"><h2>Function Documentation<span id=\"func-definition\" class=\"self-anchor\"><a class=\"perm\" href=\"#func-definition\">#<\/a><\/span><\/h2><div><h3>CMU_Calibrate<span id=\"cmu-calibrate\" class=\"self-anchor\"><a class=\"perm\" href=\"#cmu-calibrate\">#<\/a><\/span><\/h3><blockquote>uint32_t CMU_Calibrate (uint32_t cycles, <a href=\"http://docs.silabs.com/gecko-platform/5.2.2/platform-emlib-efr32xg24/cmu#cmu-select-type-def\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\">CMU_Select_TypeDef<\/a> ref)<\/blockquote><p style=\"color:inherit\">Calibrate an oscillator. <\/p><div class=\"parameters-section\"><strong class=\"parameters\">Parameters<\/strong><table><thead><tr><th>Type<\/th><th>Direction<\/th><th>Argument Name<\/th><th>Description<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td>uint32_t<\/td><td>[in]<\/td><td class=\"paramname\">cycles<\/td><td><p style=\"color:inherit\">The number of HCLK cycles to run calibration. Increasing this number increases precision, but the calibration will take more time.<\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://docs.silabs.com/gecko-platform/5.2.2/platform-emlib-efr32xg24/cmu#cmu-select-type-def\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\">CMU_Select_TypeDef<\/a><\/td><td>[in]<\/td><td class=\"paramname\">ref<\/td><td><p style=\"color:inherit\">The reference clock used to compare against HCLK.<\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div><p style=\"color:inherit\">Run a calibration of a selectable reference clock againt HCLK. Please refer to the reference manual, CMU chapter, for further details.<\/p><p style=\"color:inherit\"><strong>Note<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"list-style:\"><li><p style=\"color:inherit\">This function will not return until calibration measurement is completed.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"color:inherit\"><strong>Returns<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"list-style:\"><li><p style=\"color:inherit\">The number of ticks the selected reference clock ticked while running cycles ticks of the HCLK clock. <\/p><\/li><\/ul><br><\/div><div><h3>CMU_CalibrateConfig<span id=\"cmu-calibrate-config\" class=\"self-anchor\"><a class=\"perm\" href=\"#cmu-calibrate-config\">#<\/a><\/span><\/h3><blockquote>void CMU_CalibrateConfig (uint32_t downCycles, <a href=\"http://docs.silabs.com/gecko-platform/5.2.2/platform-emlib-efr32xg24/cmu#cmu-select-type-def\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\">CMU_Select_TypeDef<\/a> downSel, <a href=\"http://docs.silabs.com/gecko-platform/5.2.2/platform-emlib-efr32xg24/cmu#cmu-select-type-def\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\">CMU_Select_TypeDef<\/a> upSel)<\/blockquote><p style=\"color:inherit\">Configure clock calibration. <\/p><div class=\"parameters-section\"><strong class=\"parameters\">Parameters<\/strong><table><thead><tr><th>Type<\/th><th>Direction<\/th><th>Argument Name<\/th><th>Description<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td>uint32_t<\/td><td>[in]<\/td><td class=\"paramname\">downCycles<\/td><td><p style=\"color:inherit\">The number of downSel clock cycles to run calibration. Increasing this number increases precision, but the calibration will take more time.<\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://docs.silabs.com/gecko-platform/5.2.2/platform-emlib-efr32xg24/cmu#cmu-select-type-def\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\">CMU_Select_TypeDef<\/a><\/td><td>[in]<\/td><td class=\"paramname\">downSel<\/td><td><p style=\"color:inherit\">The clock which will be counted down downCycles cycles.<\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://docs.silabs.com/gecko-platform/5.2.2/platform-emlib-efr32xg24/cmu#cmu-select-type-def\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\">CMU_Select_TypeDef<\/a><\/td><td>[in]<\/td><td class=\"paramname\">upSel<\/td><td><p style=\"color:inherit\">The reference clock, the number of cycles generated by this clock will be counted and added up, the result can be given with the <a href=\"http://docs.silabs.com/gecko-platform/5.2.2/platform-emlib-efr32xg24/cmu#cmu-calibrate-count-get\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\">CMU_CalibrateCountGet()<\/a> function call. <\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div><p style=\"color:inherit\">Configure a calibration for a selectable clock source against another selectable reference clock. Refer to the reference manual, CMU chapter, for further details.<\/p><p style=\"color:inherit\"><strong>Note<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"list-style:\"><li><p style=\"color:inherit\">After configuration, a call to <a href=\"http://docs.silabs.com/gecko-platform/5.2.2/platform-emlib-efr32xg24/cmu#cmu-calibrate-start\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\">CMU_CalibrateStart()<\/a> is required, and the resulting calibration value can be read with the <a href=\"http://docs.silabs.com/gecko-platform/5.2.2/platform-emlib-efr32xg24/cmu#cmu-calibrate-count-get\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\">CMU_CalibrateCountGet()<\/a> function call.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><br><\/div><div><h3>CMU_CalibrateCountGet<span id=\"cmu-calibrate-count-get\" class=\"self-anchor\"><a class=\"perm\" href=\"#cmu-calibrate-count-get\">#<\/a><\/span><\/h3><blockquote>uint32_t CMU_CalibrateCountGet (void )<\/blockquote><p style=\"color:inherit\">Get calibration count value. <\/p><div class=\"parameters-section\"><strong class=\"parameters\">Parameters<\/strong><table><thead><tr><th>Type<\/th><th>Direction<\/th><th>Argument Name<\/th><th>Description<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td>void<\/td><td>N/A<\/td><td class=\"paramname\"><\/td><td><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div><p style=\"color:inherit\"><strong>Note<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"list-style:\"><li><p style=\"color:inherit\">If continuous calibration mode is active, calibration busy will almost always be off, and reading the value will be just needed, where the normal case would be that this function call has been triggered by the CALRDY interrupt flag.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"color:inherit\"><strong>Returns<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"list-style:\"><li><p style=\"color:inherit\">Calibration count, the number of UPSEL clocks (see <a href=\"http://docs.silabs.com/gecko-platform/5.2.2/platform-emlib-efr32xg24/cmu#cmu-calibrate-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\">CMU_CalibrateConfig()<\/a>) in the period of DOWNSEL oscillator clock cycles configured by a previous write operation to CMU-&gt;CALCNT. <\/p><\/li><\/ul><br><\/div><div><h3>CMU_ClkOutPinConfig<span id=\"cmu-clk-out-pin-config\" class=\"self-anchor\"><a class=\"perm\" href=\"#cmu-clk-out-pin-config\">#<\/a><\/span><\/h3><blockquote>void CMU_ClkOutPinConfig (uint32_t clkNo, <a href=\"http://docs.silabs.com/gecko-platform/5.2.2/platform-emlib-efr32xg24/cmu#cmu-select-type-def\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\">CMU_Select_TypeDef<\/a> sel, <a href=\"http://docs.silabs.com/gecko-platform/5.2.2/platform-emlib-efr32xg24/cmu#cmu-clk-div-type-def\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\">CMU_ClkDiv_TypeDef<\/a> clkDiv, <a href=\"http://docs.silabs.com/gecko-platform/5.2.2/platform-emlib-efr32xg24/gpio#gpio-port-type-def\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\">GPIO_Port_TypeDef<\/a> port, unsigned int pin)<\/blockquote><p style=\"color:inherit\">Direct a clock to a GPIO pin. <\/p><div class=\"parameters-section\"><strong class=\"parameters\">Parameters<\/strong><table><thead><tr><th>Type<\/th><th>Direction<\/th><th>Argument Name<\/th><th>Description<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td>u